{"product_id":"vogue-smartwatch","title":"Vogue Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eVogue Smart Watch Description!\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Vogue Smartwatch from ZeroLifestyle is a perfect blend of style, functionality, and durability. Designed for fitness enthusiasts and busy professionals alike, this smartwatch offers a plethora of features to keep you connected and on top of your health goals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Vogue Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Vogue \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003ecomes with a vivid full-color touch display that remains clear even under bright sunlight.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts comfortable, lightweight strap ensures it can be worn all day. Key features include continuous heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and tracking for various activities like walking, running, and cycling.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt also includes a step counter and calorie tracker, helping you stay on top of your fitness goals. Smart notifications allow you to receive calls, texts, and social media alerts directly on your wrist, ensuring you never miss an important message.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Vogue Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHealth Tracking: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eActivity Tracking: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnectivity: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Life: Multi-day battery life\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: Suitable for intense workouts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustomization: Multiple watch faces\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Silver","offer_id":48892245508374,"sku":"20684","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":48892245377302,"sku":"20683","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold Blue","offer_id":48892245475606,"sku":"20685","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":48892245410070,"sku":"20687","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gold Black","offer_id":48892245442838,"sku":"20686","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Vogue_Silver_0000.webp?v=1742632877","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/vogue-smartwatch","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}